  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">Russian Republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Union State (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVW5pb25fU3RhdGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Flag of Russia\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/d4/Flag_of_Russia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20171203142355\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Russia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Russia.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2029–2139</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"European Association\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/12/European_Association.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170817172319\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"European Association.png\" data-image-key=\"European_Association.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9c/Russian_Republic.png/revision/latest?cb=20150817154009\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Russia\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9c/Russian_Republic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20150817154009\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Russian Republic.png\" data-image-key=\"Russian_Republic.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">Moscow\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Federal semi-presidential constitutional republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>National Assembly\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Upper house\n</td>\n<td>National Council\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Lower house\n</td>\n<td>State Duma\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">May 16, 2029\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Dissolution\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\">European Association</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Russia</b>, officially the&#160;<b>Russian Republic</b>,&#160;was a&#160;sovereign nation&#160;in&#160;Europe that existed from 2029 to 2138, collapsing as a result of the Intermarium defeat in the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a>. Founded following the collapse of the Union State and Russia's balkanization at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Little_Cold_War\" title=\"Little Cold War\">Little Cold War</a>, the Russian Republic was a federal semi-presidential constitutional republic bordered by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Karelia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS2FyZWxpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Karelia</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Nenetsia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTmVuZXRzaWE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Nenetsia</span>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Finland (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmlubGFuZD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Finland</span> to the north, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ural Republic (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXJhbF9SZXB1YmxpYz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Ural Republic</span> to the east, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Don Republic (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRG9uX1JlcHVibGljP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Don Republic</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Samara Republic (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2FtYXJhX1JlcHVibGljP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Samara Republic</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tatarstan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGF0YXJzdGFuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tatarstan</span>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Bashkortostan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmFzaGtvcnRvc3Rhbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Bashkortostan</span> to the south, and <a href=\"/wiki/Ukraine\" title=\"Ukraine\">Ukraine</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poland\" title=\"Poland\">Poland</a> to the west. The official language of Russia is Russian. The primary religion practiced in the Russian Republic is Eastern Orthodox, although there is no official religion in Russia. The capital of Russia, Moscow, is renowned as one the of the largest and most urbanized capitals in the world, with other large cities including Novgorod and Kazan.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Russian_Empire\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Russian Empire</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Soviet_Union\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Soviet Union</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Russian_Federation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Russian Federation</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Republic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Republic</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRussia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Russian_Empire\"><b>Russian Empire</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRussia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Soviet_Union\"><b>Soviet Union</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRussia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Russian_Federation\"><b>Russian Federation</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRussia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Republic\"><b>Republic</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRussia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Facing new strains of antibiotic resistant bacteria, in 2025, western governments began aggressively funding research into Phage therapy. The new Russian Republic's economy saw a major uptick as phage treatments in use for more than a century found a demand in the West.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205709\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 890/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8532/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1383/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 15/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639891/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.393      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   44.393      1 -total\n 58.22%   25.845      2 Template:Ns0\n 52.11%   23.133      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 25.63%   11.379      2 Template:Str_find\n  4.03%    1.787      2 Template:Ordinal\n  3.59%    1.593      1 Template:Both\n  3.21%    1.425      2 Template:!!\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1683-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205709 and revision id 11554. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
